    # CAGE ROW FAIRING (25 October 2026): each named row of the cage is measured station by station and carries their noise
    # (wavy sides, bumpy roof : seen once the subdivision was removed, RowLoft.py) ; every row is replaced by a penalised
    # cubic B-spline along z (knots every knot_m, second difference penalty lam, ends held). Arch rows keep their values
